-- Bulk import/refresh of 159 real Dubai communities from the
-- provided CSV (dubai_communities_import.csv). Matches existing rows by
-- slug and updates them in place (preserving id, so linked projects and
-- favorites keep working) rather than deleting + recreating; every other
-- row is inserted fresh. Every community also gets a distinct pin_color
-- (golden-angle hue distribution) since the previous 6-color palette was
-- heavily reused across communities.

on conflict (slug) do update set
  name = excluded.name,
  lat = excluded.lat,
  lng = excluded.lng,
  boundary_radius_km = excluded.boundary_radius_km,
  meta_title = excluded.meta_title,
  meta_description = excluded.meta_description,
  pin_color = excluded.pin_color;
